  message: "Shipped (merged to dev as fd00f96c8). Root-parser --backend flag with two choices (tree-sitter default, rust-analyzer) + argv-strip pattern matching --debug so the flag works in any position relative to the subcommand. --backend rust-analyzer sets HYPERGUMBO_RUST_ANALYZER=1 in the env; --backend tree-sitter leaves env untouched. --backend=VALUE equals-form supported. Invalid choices rejected by argparse. 11 tests, 100% coverage. Closes the rust-analyzer backend UX: opt-in via env var OR --backend flag, install via install-rust-analyzer or install-extras, registered analyzer handles dispatch with graceful-degrade to rust.py on any failure."  # 3f3a
